    },
    "description": "<p>You may spend 10 MP to track prey that is not currently in the scene and whose leads can be followed through conventional, hunter-related means. The target must roll an Opposed <strong>【WLP + INS】</strong> Check against you, and you gain a bonus equal to <strong>【SL】</strong> on this check.</p><p>If the tracking is successful, you arrive at the prey’s location. If a conﬂict begins, your ﬁrst Accuracy Check gains a bonus of <strong>【 SL 】</strong> against the prey. If successful, it deals an additional <strong>【HR + 15】</strong> damage.</p><p>This ability ends if you are reduced to 0 HP, attack the prey, choose to track another target, or by Game Master ruling.</p>",
